Python practice codes for the listed repository files
This pack contains code examples under the filenames shown in the repository list. The .txt files contain Python source code too; run them with python "filename.txt" if your Python installation accepts the explicit filename, or rename the extension to .py.
The 20 cleaned .py examples from the earlier bundle are also included in python_codes_complete/. Examples are educational implementations based on the file names and the earlier conversation; where the original repository text was not provided, a matching example has been reconstructed rather than claimed as a verbatim copy.
Run a file from a terminal, for example: python binary_search.py.